What This Does
A 32-bit programmable countdown timer peripheral integrated into the FemtoRV32 RISC-V SoC.

CPU writes a countdown value into the LOAD register
CPU sets EN=1 in CTRL to start counting
Hardware decrements VALUE every clock cycle
When VALUE hits 0 → TIMEOUT flag is set in STATUS
CPU polls STATUS, sees TIMEOUT=1, clears it, toggles an LED
In periodic mode it auto-reloads and repeats forever


